OL,3,GNEWSAKayakers died after sailing on
OL,4,Ainflatables they earlier repaired,
OL,5,Ainquest hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo kayakers died after sailing on
OL,8,Finflatable kayaks they had earlier
OL,9,Frepaired with "duct tape and a puncture
OL,10,Frepair kit", an inquest has heard.
OL,12,FFather-of-four Simon Wilson, 35, and
OL,13,FConnor Parfitt, 24, both worked as
OL,14,Fcleaners at Hafan y Mor holiday park
OL,15,Fnear Pwllheli, Gwynedd, where they also
OL,16,Flived in staff accommodation.
OL,18,FBoth disappeared after setting out from
OL,19,Fa beach near the holiday park on the
OL,20,Fevening of 21 July 2026.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
