OL,3,GNEWSAKayakers died after sailing on
OL,4,Ainflatables they earlier repaired,
OL,5,Ainquest hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Friday, a coroner from Caernarfon
OL,8,FCoroner's Court said their kayaks may
OL,9,Fhave become damaged while out at sea,
OL,10,Fand concluded their deaths were an
OL,11,Faccident.
